---
import Button from '../common/Button.astro'
---
<section class="paint-edge relative overflow-hidden bg-white">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl items-center gap-8 px-6 pb-20 pt-20 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:px-10 lg:pt-28">
    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-xl">
      <p class="section-label"><span data-rotating-message>Disciplina que transforma</span></p>
      <h1 class="display-title mt-4 text-6xl sm:text-8xl">Entrenamiento funcional y artes marciales</h1>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-md text-sm leading-7 text-neutral-600">Disciplina, fuerza y comunidad. Entrena con profesionales y construye hábitos que se mantienen contigo.</p>
      <div class="mt-8"><Button href="#disciplinas">Conoce nuestras disciplinas</Button></div>
    </div>
    <div data-reveal class="relative mx-auto w-full max-w-xl">
      <div class="absolute inset-8 rotate-3 bg-brand-red/90 blur-sm"></div>
      <img data-hover-image src="/images/hero-gym.jpg" alt="Entrenamiento en Spark Fit Center" class="interactive-image relative h-[420px] w-full rounded-xl object-cover drop-shadow-2xl" />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
